  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Chevron Usa obligated $366M in federal contract dollars in FY2026 to date. Chevron Usa won 83 awards so far in the fiscal year, with an average award size of $4.4M, and obligations are up 58.6% year over year. Chevron Usa obligations have trended upward since FY21: FY21 $55.8M, FY22 $116M, FY23 $180M, FY24 $132M, FY25 $231M, FY26 $366M. Chevron Usa current-year totals are partial because FY2026 is fiscal year to date. Chevron Usa award-count and average-award-size metrics show a program of relatively large awards rather than many small purchases. Chevron Usa funding is concentrated in recent years, with FY25 and FY26 together accounting for a large share of the company’s cumulative obligations across the six fiscal years listed.",
